text Even by the following morning, Ushio's fever still hasn't gone down.
text I should call a doctor today.
text But I can't take two days off of work.
text What should I do...?
text I guess I'll ask for Sanae-san's help...
text I can't help it. This is an emergency.
text I pick up the phone and dial her number.
sound PNY.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Yes? This is Furukawa."
text @[Tomoya]
text It's Okazaki...
sound PNZ.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Tomoya-san? What's the matter, calling this early in the morning?"
text @[Tomoya]
text Ushio's had a fever since yesterday... and it's not going down.
sound PO0.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "That sounds quite bad. I understand. I'll be right over."
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm sorry for the trouble.
sound PO1.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "No problem at all. See you soon."
text She responds quickly.
