text I hear the sound of fireworks exploding in the distance.
text They signal the start of field day.
sound POC.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Field day.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well...
sound POD.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Are you not going to run, Daddy?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, I'm not going to. Today's Sunday, anyway. I'll be by your side the whole day.
sound POE.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...What about Akky?
text @[Tomoya]
text The old man might run.
sound POF.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Go beat him.
text @[Tomoya]
text No. Like I said, I'm going to be with you.
sound POG.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I wish you could beat him.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, yeah? You're on my side, right?
sound POH.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yeah.
text @[Tomoya]
text So I'm on your side too.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm going to protect you, no matter what happens.
sound POI.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Okay.
text I think she didn't really want me to go. She looks happy as she closes her eyes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you going to sleep?
sound POJ.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yes.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's okay. I'm not going anywhere.
sound POK.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Okay...
text She quickly drifts off into sleep.
text She looks truly calm and relieved.
