text @[Tomoya]
text ...I'm sorry.
text I bow my head deeply.
text I know this isn't nearly enough to make up for the trouble I've caused, but I still have to do it.
sound POL.aac
text @[Boss]
text Personally, I don't want you to quit, Okazaki-kun.
sound POM.aac
text @[Boss]
text But it sounds like you have a lot going on.
text I decide to quit my job.
text I don't know what's next for me. My future is filled with nothing but uncertainty.
text Sanae-san tried desperately to stop me too.
text But I believe that this is my only option.
text I have to do this if I want to protect Ushio.
text I know it's not easy to protect her while trying to keep up with other stuff.
text I'm sure it was the same with my dad.
text He made a lot of sacrifices.
text That's why I'm firm when I make my decision.
sound PON.aac
text @[Boss]
text Come by and say hi if you're ever in the area.
sound POO.aac
text @[Boss]
text We'll all be waiting for you.
text I hear regret in the boss's voice.
text While it makes me feel grateful, it also hurts.
