text @[Yoshino]
text Oh, Okazaki. It's you. Today's your last day, right?
text Yoshino-san is standing behind me. He must have just gotten back from his job site.
sound POQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You did good work while you were here.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I have you to thank for that.
text Yoshino-san pats me on the shoulder without saying another word.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I'm grateful for everything you did for me.
