text @[Yoshino]
text Wait.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...What is it?
sound POS.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Here, take it. Don't lose it.
text He hands me a screwdriver with a poorly-scrawled "Yoshino" inscribed on it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Really? Are you sure?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS16"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
