fi
sound POT.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Of course not. How am I supposed to do work tomorrow?
sound POU.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So let me borrow yours instead.
sound POV.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'm just going to borrow it.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS13"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
