	fi
fi
sound POW.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'll return it once you come back.
text Yoshino says the words with a laugh.
text While we've worked together for such a long time, I've rarely had the chance to see him smile.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS12"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
