text So come back whenever you want once your daughter gets better.
sound POY.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'll be borrowing it until then.
text I silently take the screwdriver from my bag.
text I don't say anything because I feel as though I'm about to start spilling forth more than words.
sound POZ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Okay, I'll be holding on to this.
sound PP0.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'll take good care of it.
text I nod to him as hard as I can.
text The one gesture contains all of the gratitude I've built up for him over the past several years.
