text But her fever must be making her dizzy. She trips over her own feet and almost falls.
text I reach out and hold her tiny body.
text Tears begin to form in her eyes. She must be feeling frustrated.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's okay, Ushio...
text @[Tomoya]
text You don't have to be able to do it by yourself right now...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll change your clothes for you... So come on, raise your arms...
text @[Tomoya]
text Here...
text Our peaceful days...
