text @[Tomoya]
text Ushio... is there anything you want?
text @[Tomoya]
text Tell me if there is. I'll buy you anything you want.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Toys, candy, anything.
sound PP3.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...
sound PP4.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I wanna go on a trip.
text @[Tomoya]
text A trip?
sound PP5.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yes.
sound PP6.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Another trip with you, Daddy.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I look away, unable to speak for a while.
sound PP7.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...We went on a trip... over summer break.
sound PP8.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...And it was fun.
text @[Tomoya]
text Silly...
text @[Tomoya]
text How was that fun...?
text @[Tomoya]
text We were fighting the entire time...
text If I had gone with her as the man I am today, I could've made it so much more fun for her...
text But then...
text But then, Ushio...
sound PP9.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I wanna go on a trip again.
sound PPA.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I wanna get on a train...
sound PPB.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...With you, Daddy...
text @[Tomoya]
text Once you get better... let's do that...
sound PPC.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I wanna go now.
sound PPD.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Right now...
text @[Tomoya]
text C'mon... Ushio...
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't be unreasonable... What am I supposed to do...?
sound PPE.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...
text Ushio isn't a selfish child.
text But I still can't grant her the one wish she has...
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't that ridiculous...
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't that...?
