text I...
text Our family...
text Is this town just toying with all of us...?
text Does it give us happiness as a prank...
text Just to swipe it away from us later...?
text Does it do that... to sneer at us?
text To laugh at us as we drown in sorrow...?
text I'll never forgive it...
text I swear I'll save her, even if I can't save anyone else...
text At the very least, I'll save her...
